  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please add/replace the external API object field on VRC_Station and VRC_Pickup, so that we can (optionally) assign an UdonBehaviour there that will receive all VRChat events, such as OnPickup(), OnPlayerEnter() etc. while being attached to another gameObject.\nThis would allow us to set the script for a pickup to manual sync or have one script handle multiple pickups or stations, e.g. to have different stations for VR and Desktop users without the need for an \"event forwarder\" script that adds unwanted overhead and complexity.\nVRC_Stations in SDK3 still have the (deprecated) field \"VRC_Object Api\" which could be removed/replaced in that step.",
